  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Financiamiento de Energa Renovable en las Zonas No Interconectadas</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Renewable Energy Financing Program for the Non Interconnected Zones</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es promover y aumentar la inversin privada en la generacin de Energa Renovable en Zonas No Interconectadas (ZNI) y localidades aisladas, reduciendo la emisin de Gases de Efecto Invernadero (GEI), a travs de la provisin de financiamiento de largo plazo en condiciones adecuadas a los inversores privados.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the program is to promote and increase private investments in RE generation in the Non Interconnected Zones (ZNIs) and isolated localities while reducing Greenhouse Gas (GHG) emissions. This would be achieved by providing long term financing with adequate conditions to private investors.</narrative>
  </description>
